  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 102.62 “District plan” means “district plan” as defined in RSA 149-M:4, VIII, namely “the plan developed for waste management within a district, and approved by the department.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; renumbered by #13357 (formerly Env-Sw 102.52); ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 102.50) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
